{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":90388,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k3ZCwAJSTHVTJr3CcsemkZLc5eA.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3029205","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「颯馬って、いつ私のこと好きになったの？」――涼を泊まりのデートに連れて行く颯馬。グランピングやサーフィンなど颯馬ならではのデートプランは、期待以上の楽しいひと時に。そして夜、颯馬はさらにサプライズを用意していて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dN1vC0uUy7c9IzplktH0lzQY2qc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dN1vC0uUy7c9IzplktH0lzQY2qc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"3029210","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「逃げんなよ。せっかく8年ぶりに会ったのに」――会議に現れたのは、涼の元カレ・玲だった。スルーしようとする涼だが、玲はそんな反応を楽しむように絡んでくる。一方、颯馬は研修のためしばらく離れることになっていて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yKKmIW8kgg9vpaqlp8ZrcbAPR4O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yKKmIW8kgg9vpaqlp8ZrcbAPR4O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"3029211","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「馬鹿。褒めたんだよ」――仕事でトラブルが発生し、協力する涼と玲。上手く乗り越えた涼は、研修帰りの颯馬を機嫌よく出迎える。しかし、偶然あるものを見てしまっていた颯馬は、涼との関係に焦りを覚えていて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bIHwGW6yJjYRPYbW3MSbiejytsI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bIHwGW6yJjYRPYbW3MSbiejytsI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"3029212","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"​「俺の恋人のフリをしてくれ」――涼と玲が2人で市場調査に出掛けることに。それを止められなかった颯馬は消防署でも悩んでいた。すると、羽瀬と泉が面白半分でひとつの提案をしてきて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zI9xoz0iNxokKWgum2Ams1A55wW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zI9xoz0iNxokKWgum2Ams1A55wW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"3029213","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「彼は涼の友人です。な？」――玲の頼みに応じ手を繋ぐ涼。動揺した颯馬たちは尾行がばれ、松井を含めた全員が鉢合わせに。そんな中、颯馬をただの知り合いだと偽る涼に、颯馬は気持ちを抑えきれなくなって…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cmvJvFmBKfz245gyvgfYTDvJP4V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cmvJvFmBKfz245gyvgfYTDvJP4V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"3029214","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"​「今は噂でも、本当のことにしてみせる」――涼の意に反し、玲と付き合っているという誤解は会社にも広まっていた。否定しない玲に頭を抱える涼。しかも帰宅すると、颯馬の見た目や行動がおかしくなっていて…。\n\nシナリオ：黒崎エーヨ / コンテ：わたせとしひろ / 演出：本山竜 / 作画監督：西川真人・大飛龍狂一・阿部楓子","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xeqaL1VFhFtF5b7vG3Nt75fKCco.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xeqaL1VFhFtF5b7vG3Nt75fKCco.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"3029215","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"​「一度でいい。必ず振り向かせる」――消防士が技術を競う全国消防救助技術大会。颯馬が出ると知った涼は、彼女らしく応援したいと観に行くことに。だがそこには、実は涼以外の人物も来ていて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xlXFf9c2eGKEbiV7TUpwqyi5OJE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xlXFf9c2eGKEbiV7TUpwqyi5OJE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"3029216","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「颯馬と一緒だから、私は私らしくいられるんだと思う」――遊園地に集ってコスプレした、いつものメンバーと玲。玲は、颯馬がいるとわかりつつも涼へのアプローチを試みる。と、思ったのも束の間、ハロウィン中の遊園地は過激なホラーなイベントと化していて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":7,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sYvtdvRq5lcZgCTbTXO5KH7MdKA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sYvtdvRq5lcZgCTbTXO5KH7MdKA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2/episode/8"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/90388/season/2"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793433359093,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
